{"id":"588e8fcba7d283dc","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-normal-form.md","title":"Boolean DNF Exists without New Letters","display":"lem-gl-normal-form — Boolean DNF Exists without New Letters","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-normal-form","aliases":["89-lem-gl-normal-form"],"display":"lem-gl-normal-form — Boolean DNF Exists without New Letters","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-normal-form]]","[[89-lem-gl-decomposition]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-normal-form — Boolean DNF Exists without New Letters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" href=\"?note=0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" title=\"89-df-gl-normal-form\">89-df-gl-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db8da4f25311c498\" href=\"?note=db8da4f25311c498\" title=\"89-lem-gl-decomposition\">89-lem-gl-decomposition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为普通模态文字 DNF 类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是字母集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n\\left[(A\\leftrightarrow N)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(N)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n\\left[(A\\leftrightarrow N)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(N)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 4–5（本库展开）；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>取有限分解引理的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,\\Gamma\">\\(m,\\Gamma\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 为其折叠析取。定义直接给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(N\\in\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>，引理给可证等价。按有限折叠的字母集递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 的字母集是全部文字字母集的有限并，故保留字母界。原有存在陈述作为第一部分保留；这是普通 Boolean DNF，不冒充无字母迹正规化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"0b3c8928cef7eaa4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-decomposition","status":"resolved","id":"db8da4f25311c498","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-decomposition]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n\\left[(A\\leftrightarrow N)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(N)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"m,\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false}],"bytes":1290,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般替换：[[89-lem-normal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-modalized-replacement]]。普通 DNF：[[89-df-gl-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-gl-decomposition]] → [[89-lem-gl-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["0b3c8928cef7eaa4","db8da4f25311c498"]}